Meta.documentation:List.remove
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Takes one element out of a flowing list by position.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The index (0-based) arrives as a Number in the flow or as a
Meta.documentation:parameter (?|index=1). Every other element passes through
Meta.documentation:with its own type, in order. Elements are buffered until the
Meta.documentation:list ends so the index may arrive anywhere in the flow.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A list can mix any types, so results cannot be bound at compile time:
Meta.documentation:like http:, the operator declares no typed outputs — it late-connects,
Meta.documentation:wrapping each result in its own typed resource at execution time and
Meta.documentation:connecting that to the downstream connectee (see docs/output-interfaces.md).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_index — position to remove (parameter drop-in)
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_$all — String element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — Number element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_$all — Blob element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all — Boolean element candidate
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:a String:b String:c]>>List.remove:?|index=1>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:a
Meta.documentation:c
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see List.get List.length
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20castLib%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Scheme%2Fcast%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Removes%20one%20element%20from%20a%20flowing%20list%20by%20position%20(0-based)%3B%0A%2F%2F%20every%20other%20element%20passes%20through%20with%20its%20own%20type%2C%20in%20order.%0A%2F%2F%20A%20list%20can%20mix%20any%20types%2C%20so%20each%20passing%20element's%20type%20is%20known%20only%20at%0A%2F%2F%20execution%20time%20%E2%80%94%20remove%20declares%20no%20typed%20outputs%3B%20like%20http%3A%2C%20it%0A%2F%2F%20late-connects%20each%20passing%20element%20in%20its%20own%20typed%20resource.%0A%2F%2F%20The%20index%20is%20a%20Number%20in%20the%20flow%20or%20a%20parameter%3A%20%3F%7Cindex%3D1%0A%2F%2F%20%5BString%3Aa%20String%3Ab%20String%3Ac%5D%3E%3EList.remove%3A%3F%7Cindex%3D1%20emits%20a%2C%20c%0Afunction%20remove()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22remove%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DremoveProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20removeProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.index%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09this.elements%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09return%20this.fire_end_parameters()%3B%20%2F%2F%20pre-positioned%20parameter%20inputs%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20function%20collect(type)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09return%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.elements.push(%7Btype%3Atype%2C%20value%3Ainput.value%7D)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_Number_index%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09this.index%20%3D%20Math.floor(input.value.valueOf())%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22String%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22Number%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Boolean_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22Boolean%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_octetstream_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22octetstream%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20i%20in%20this.elements)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(Number(i)%20%3D%3D%3D%20this.index%20%7C%7C%20!this.connectee)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20late%20connect%20(like%20http%3A)%20%E2%80%94%20the%20type%20is%20known%20only%20now%0A%09%09%09let%20cast%20%3D%20castLib.castValue(this.elements%5Bi%5D.type%2C%20this.elements%5Bi%5D.value)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(cast)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09cast.connect(this.connectee)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09cast.in_go%3F.()%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Aremove.Processor%3DremoveProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dremove%3B]>>NewResource:List.remove
